# Vercel Web Analytics Implementation Report

## Summary
Vercel Web Analytics has been successfully configured for this Astro project according to the latest official documentation from https://vercel.com/docs/analytics/quickstart.

## Implementation Status
✅ **COMPLETE** - All required configuration is already in place and verified working.

## What Was Configured

### 1. Package Installation
- **Package**: `@vercel/analytics` version ^2.0.1
- **Status**: Already installed in package.json
- **Manager**: npm (using package-lock.json)

### 2. Astro Configuration (`astro.config.mjs`)
Following the official Astro-specific instructions, the following configuration is present:

```javascript
export default defineConfig({
  output: 'server',
  adapter: vercel({
    webAnalytics: {
      enabled: true,
    },
  }),
});
```

**Key configurations:**
- ✅ `output: 'server'` - Required for Vercel adapter
- ✅ `webAnalytics: { enabled: true }` - Enables Vercel Web Analytics
- ✅ Using `@astrojs/vercel` adapter version ^10.0.6

### 3. Analytics Component Integration (`src/pages/index.astro`)
The Analytics component is properly imported and placed in the document head:

```astro
---
import Analytics from '@vercel/analytics/astro';
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <!-- ... other meta tags ... -->
    <Analytics />
  </head>
  <body>
    <!-- ... content ... -->
  </body>
</html>
```

